          "items": [
            "This home is professionally managed by Beach Habitats 30A and comes with 6 adult bicycles as well as access to Rosemary Beach Amenities. <br><br>Discover Luxury at Rosemary Cottage: Your Ultimate Rosemary Beach Vacation Rental on 30A<br>Escape to paradise at Rosemary Cottage, a stunning 5-bedroom, 5.5-bathroom luxury vacation home in the heart of Rosemary Beach, Florida. Professionally managed by Beach Habitats 30A, this exquisite beach retreat sleeps up to 14 guests and includes exclusive perks like 6 complimentary adult bicycles for exploring the scenic 30A coastline, plus full access to Rosemary Beach's world-class amenities—think pristine beaches, boutique shopping, gourmet dining, fitness centers, tennis courts, and community pools. Perfect for family reunions, multi-generational getaways, or group vacations, this home blends coastal elegance with modern comforts, ensuring an unforgettable stay just steps from the sugar-white sands of the Emerald Coast.<br>Why Book Rosemary Cottage? Top Highlights for Your Dream Beach Vacation<br><br>Private Outdoor Oasis: Dive into your own heated swimming pool (optional heating available for a fee), gather around the unique 4-sided outdoor fireplace for cozy evenings, and fire up the grilling area for al fresco dinners. Relax on the screened-in porch or spacious lounge areas—ideal for unwinding after a day at the beach.<br>Prime Location: Nestled at 132 East Kingston Road on the north side of 30A, you're a short walk to award-winning restaurants, upscale shops, and the vibrant town square. Quick access to all Rosemary Beach amenities means no long drives—just pure relaxation. Plus, the home's proximity to Seacrest, Alys Beach, and Inlet Beach opens up endless adventures along Florida's iconic Scenic Highway 30A.<br>Luxury Amenities Included: Enjoy high-end designer furnishings, gourmet kitchen essentials, flat-screen TVs in every bedroom and living space, high-speed Wi-Fi, a full laundry room, and ample parking. Linens, towels, and starter toiletries are provided, so you can pack light and focus on fun.<br>Family-Friendly Features: With bunk beds for kids (and adults!), multiple balconies for private moments, and open-concept spaces for group gatherings, this home is designed for comfort and connection. Sleeps 14 comfortably across the main house and separate carriage house—no cramped quarters here.<br>Eco-Conscious Touches: Rosemary Beach is a walkable, bike-friendly community committed to sustainability, making your stay as green as it is glamorous.<br><br>Detailed Home Layout: Everything You Need to Know<br>Rosemary Cottage features a thoughtful design across the main house and detached carriage house, with plenty of space to spread out. Here's a floor-by-floor breakdown:<br>First Floor (Main House):<br><br>Outdoor Paradise: Step outside to your private heated pool, 4-sided fireplace, dedicated grilling station, screened-in porch, and lounge seating—perfect for poolside cocktails or family barbecues.<br>Bedroom 1: King bed with plush linens, flat-screen TV, and ensuite bathroom featuring a walk-in shower. Ideal for guests seeking main-level convenience.<br>Living & Kitchen Area: Bright, open-concept space flooded with natural light. The gourmet kitchen boasts high-end appliances, granite countertops, and all the cookware you need for meals. Relax in the living room with designer furnishings and a large flat-screen TV.<br>Dining: Seats 6 at the elegant dining table, plus 4 more at the kitchen island—great for group meals or casual breakfasts.<br>Additional Conveniences: Half bathroom for quick access and a full laundry room with washer/dryer.<br><br>Second Floor (Main House):<br><br>Master Suite: Spacious king bed, flat-screen TV, walk-in closet, and luxurious ensuite with double vanity, walk-in shower, standalone soaking tub, and private balcony overlooking a serene green space—your personal retreat for morning coffee or evening reads.<br>Bunk Room: Fun and functional with two custom bunk beds (twin-over-twin and queen-over-queen), sleeping up to 6. Includes a flat-screen TV, ensuite bathroom with walk-in shower, and private balcony for kids' hangouts.<br>Bedroom 3: King bed, flat-screen TV, ensuite bathroom with shower-tub combo, and access to a large shared balcony for fresh Gulf breezes.<br><br>Carriage House (Detached for Added Privacy):<br><br>Open Living Area: Cozy den with flat-screen TV and a compact kitchenette—perfect for in-laws or teens wanting their own space.<br>Bedroom 4: King bed with ensuite bathroom (walk-in shower) and private balcony overlooking the pool.<br><br>This layout ensures privacy while fostering togetherness, with screened porches, balconies, and outdoor areas totaling over 4,000 square feet of living space. All bedrooms have premium mattresses, blackout curtains, and ceiling fans for a restful night's sleep.<br>Explore Rosemary Beach and Beyond<br>Rosemary Beach is more than a destination—it's a lifestyle. Stroll to the beach (just a 5-10 minute walk), hop on your included bikes for a scenic ride along 30A, or indulge in nearby attractions like the Underwater Museum of Art, Eden Gardens State Park, or water sports at Grayton Beach. With year-round events, from wine festivals to outdoor concerts, there's always something happening. And don't worry about the details—our professional management team handles check-in (self-check-in available), cleaning, and any mid-stay needs, with 24/7 support for peace of mind.<br>Ready to make memories? Book Rosemary Cottage today for your luxury beach vacation on 30A—rates start competitively, and availability fills up fast! Contact Beach Habitats 30A for special offers, including extended stays or seasonal discounts. Your perfect Florida getaway awaits.",
