        "date": "2025-10-24T17:01:54Z",
        "id": "68fbbf276fb3ce5187e3f813",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our group of longtime girlfriends loved this house. We cooked together for every breakfast and dinner with plenty of room to gather, eat and talk, both inside and out. The bedrooms were spacious. The house was a short walk to the beach and shopping. Highly recommend this Vrbo.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Shandle W.",
        "date": "2025-10-14T14:09:56Z",
        "id": "68ee67e00a64080246c15543",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "text": "This property is perfect for large groups and has everything you need. It looks exactly like the photos and is a great location...close to: Alys Beach, Seaside and Seacrest. We did experience some ants in the carriage house, BUT management responded quickly and took care of it. Property Manager was very helpful. Overall, I'd rate this property 4.5 out of 5 stars!!!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
