        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We've rented many houses in Rosemary Beach and this was one of our favorites. We loved the large living area to spend time together as a family. Love the pool and outdoor grilling area. The host was very responsive. The kitchen and house were very well stocked. Great location. Convenient to everything in Rosemary.",
